        "created_at": "2011-11-05T15:04:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;beevolant&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"beevolant\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"TheJayMann\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/48/2261_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> TheJayMann:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Woo! I am now the proud owner of official artwork of the Chairman drawn and signed by Christopher himself!</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Christopher drew something for you? And then called it the “official art?” … I have seen things that Christopher has drawn and, well, no offense to him, but he’s no Adam. <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>It’s a wonderful piece of character artwork, though perhaps more wonderful for its character than for its artwork.</p>",
