        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/thejaymann/{size}/2261_2.png",
        "created_at": "2011-11-07T20:37:01.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Biggest turnout was definately Saturday Game Preserve.  Quite a few people showed up.  Quite a few people there also purchased a copy of the game.  I believe I also hosted three demos there (I may be way off, I’ve slept sense then, and apparently not enough the last time).  No place had terrible turnout though.</p>",
