        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/e/5e9695/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2011-11-07T20:48:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I really wish I could have been there for that one at the Game Preserve, but I slept in far too late, and just didn’t have the gas to go to Greenwood and Indianapolis in the same day. I’m very sad I didn’t make it. Believe me, I would have. Also, I was feeling very sick that morning and had slept until 3:00 PM, so yeah… I’d have been very late. But still, I’m really sad I missed the Rook City things you all supposedly had… I was so close!</p>",
